Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 5.4 212/459] drm/mediatek: handle events when enabling/disabling crtc
Date:   Fri, 14 Feb 2020 10:57:42 -0500
Message-Id: <20200214160149.11681-212-sashal@kernel.org>
